OL,3,GNEWSAMisconduct hearing told PCs 'lost
OL,4,Acontrol'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 92-year-old amputee who was Tasered
OL,7,Fand Pava-sprayed at his care home by
OL,8,Ftwo Sussex Police officers "posed no
OL,9,Freal or credible threat to anyone", a
OL,10,Fdisciplinary hearing has heard.
OL,12,FGross misconduct proceedings began on
OL,13,FMonday for PCs Stephen Smith, 52, and
OL,14,FRachel Comotto, 37, following an
OL,15,Fincident in June 2022 at the Park Beck
OL,16,Fcare home in St Leonards-on-Sea.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
