OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F328A1790616379
OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMisconduct hearing told PCs 'lost
OL,4,Acontrol'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn May 2025 the pair were acquitted of
OL,7,Fassault occasioning actual bodily harm,
OL,8,Fwhere it was shown Smith used
OL,9,Fincapacitating Pava spray and a baton
OL,10,Fon Donald Burgess, while Comotto
OL,11,Fdeployed her Taser.
OL,13,FOpening the case, Aaron Rathmell,
OL,14,Flawyer for Sussex Police, said the
OL,15,F"officers acted, hastily, harshly and
OL,16,Flost control".
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
